This repo deploys to a LIVE domain. Every push runs the cold fact-check
review gate (~/.claude/tools/review-gate.sh) over the outgoing diff before it
ships. Fabricated claims, invented statistics, unearned legal/licensing claims,
and third parties falsely named as clients get the push BLOCKED.

Facts of record live in docs/client-facts.md. Override with SHIP ANYWAY only if
you are certain — you own that call.
